From 8883f05716c38accf65a63d82a93dc48ed4d23ea Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: blame42 <346530647+git-blame-42@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 5 Nov 2026 17:10:59 -0300
Subject: [PATCH] feat: Choose the responsible admin for an event

user_id now comes from the form: a select lists User::admins(), with
the logged admin as default. Event::validates() requires an existing
admin, so a forged participant or unknown id is rejected instead of
breaking the foreign key. The show page displays the responsible.
